{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14276","headline":"奉诚园闻笛 · 窦牟","name":"奉诚园闻笛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾绝朱缨吐锦茵，欲披荒草访遗尘。\n秋风忽洒西园泪，满目山阳笛里人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《三体唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/三體唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}